*{{i-c|to finish}} [[enda]], [[binda enda á]]
*{{i-c|to complete}} [[klára]]
*{{i-c|to end}} [[enda]]
*{{i-c|to finalise}} [[ganga frá]]
*{{i-c|to expire}} [[renna út]]
*{{i-c|to conclude}} [[enda]]

